#: ../../site/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Native C++23 analytics for portfolios, factors, performance and risk — one "
"typed API over a local `DataFrame`, with no Python dependency at run time."
msgstr "用于投资组合、因子、业绩与风险分析的原生 C++23 库 —— 在本地 `DataFrame` 之上提供一套类型化 API，运行时不需要 Python。"

#: ../../site/index.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[Quickstart](quickstart.md){.fc-button .fc-primary} "
"[Installation](installation.md){.fc-button} [API reference](api/index.md"
"){.fc-button} [GitHub](https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp){.fc-"
"button}"
msgstr ""
"[快速开始](quickstart.md){.fc-button .fc-primary} [安装](installation.md){.fc-"
"button} [API 参考](api/index.md){.fc-button} "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp){.fc-button}"

#: ../../site/index.md:8
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp.git\n"
"cd fincore_cpp && git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp.git\n"
"cd fincore_cpp && git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"

