#: ../../site/index.md:86
msgid ""
"The library consumes its own `DataFrame` type and returns owning typed "
"results. The stable public surface is documented separately from internal "
"`fincore::detail` helpers, and optional visualization adapters are built "
"only when their CMake options and GUI dependencies are enabled."
msgstr ""
"库消费自己的 `DataFrame` 类型，并返回拥有数据的类型化结果。稳定的公共接口与内部的 `fincore::detail` "
"辅助函数分别记录；可选的绘图适配器只在相应 CMake 选项与界面依赖启用时才构建。"

#: ../../site/index.md:91
msgid ""
"Every public symbol is documented and tracked in the API ledger; both "
"language builds run strict Sphinx checks on every change, and the C++ test "
"suite runs on each push. Published state, including which platforms are "
"live, is recorded in [publication notes](publication.md) rather than "
"asserted here."
msgstr ""
"每个公共符号都有说明并由 API 清单跟踪；两种语言的构建在每次改动上都执行严格 Sphinx 检查，C++ "
"测试套件在每次推送时运行。发布状态（包括哪些平台已上线）记录在[发布说明](publication.md)中，而不是在这里断言。"

